{"t":1787846182950,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":0,"defects":["Most text shapes use default weight 400 (1/3 = 33% have non-default weight). Add typographic hierarchy per the LETTER SPACING RULES: page title=700 / section heading=600 / metric value=700 / metric label=500 / body=400. Also set letterSpacing (tighten headings -0.4 to -0.8, open labels +0.2 to +0.6) and textAlign. Either call pen_update_shape on each text layer OR regenerate via pen_generate_wireframe (the wireframe generator now emits rich typography per role).","Text critic (severity=high): I'll review this Notifications section design critically, focusing only on the 10 new shapes as instructed.\n\n---\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Fidelity Check**: This is high-fidelity — has color (#0ea5e9 primary, #ffffff surface), real content (\"Email updates\", \"Product news\"), and shadows on 3 shapes. No gradients present but not required for this utility section.\n\n**Visual Hierarchy**: The \"Notifications\" title (24px) establishes clear section hierarchy above the 16px labels. Good.\n\n**Alignment & Spacing**: \n- All shapes share identical coordinates @(400,540) — **everything is stacked at the same position**. This is a critical layout failure. The toggle rows, labels, and knobs should be vertically distributed with proper spacing.\n\n**Toggle Mechanics**: \n- Both toggles show \"on\" state (blue fill #0ea5e","VLM critic (score=2/10, severity=high):","  - [high] Re-render the Notifications section from scratch: add 'Notifications' heading with 24px bottom margin, then two full-width rows each containing left-aligned label ('Email updates', 'Product news') and right-aligned toggle switch in ON position","  - [high] Fix the toggle component: 44x24px pill shape, #0EA5E9 background when ON, white circular thumb positioned to the right, with smooth shadow","  - [high] Apply consistent card styling to Notifications: same width, 24px padding, subtle border (1px #E5E7EB), rounded corners (12px), and shadow as Account Settings card","  - [med] Establish proper flexbox row structure for each toggle: display flex, align-items center, justify-content space-between, padding 16px 0, with label at font-weight 500","  - [med] Add 24px vertical gap between Account Settings card and Notifications card to match design system spacing"],"validation":{"totalShapes":10,"textShapes":3,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":1,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":3},"textSeverity":"high","vlmSeverity":"high","vlmScore":2}}
